o deliver efficient compute performance and flexible scalability in modern data center environments. It is part of the HPE Apollo 2000 Gen10 platform and is suitable for HPC, scientific computing, big data analytics, virtualization, and enterprise applications.</p><p><br></p><p>The Apollo R2600 Gen10 supports HPE ProLiant XL170r Gen10 and XL190r Gen10 server nodes, allowing organizations to build dense and scalable computing infrastructure. Its shared chassis architecture helps optimize rack space, power distribution, and cooling while providing flexible storage and networking options.</p><p><br></p><p>With support for Intel Xeon Scalable processors, DDR4 HPE SmartMemory, high-speed networking, PCIe expansion, and SFF storage configurations, the HPE Apollo R2600 Gen10 is suitable for organizations looking for reliable and scalable server infrastructure.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>HPE Apollo R2600 Gen10 high-density server chassis</li><li>2U rack-mount form factor</li><li>Supports HPE ProLiant XL170r Gen10 and XL190r Gen10 server nodes</li><li>Intel Xeon Scalable processor support</li><li>DDR4 HPE SmartMemory support</li><li>Up to 24 SFF drive configuration</li><li>Flexible SAS, SATA, and NVMe storage options depending on configuration</li><li>PCIe 3.0 expansion support</li><li>High-speed Ethernet and networking options</li><li>Shared power and cooling infrastructure</li><li>Designed for HPC and data-intensive workloads</li><li>Suitable for virtualization and enterprise applications</li><li>Space-efficient data center deployment</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server","href":"/hpe-proliant-dl380-gen10-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL180 Gen9 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl180-gen9-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant D